"""
ocstats — descriptive statistics & cost analytics for OpenCode v2 usage.

Reads the OpenCode v2 SQLite database (read-only) and produces beautiful
text reports that can be aggregated by model, provider, date, agent,
project, session, or any combination thereof.  Cost is shown both as
reported by the provider and as estimated from token counts using
models.dev pricing (with user overrides).

Zero dependencies: Python 3.9+ standard library only.
"""

